/target

# Build outputs, reproducible with scripts/build-content.sh from the sources
# committed beside them (.keromap, .png, .obj, .keromat, .wav).
#
# The developer texture set under art/dev and art/tools is *not* here, even
# though `alchemy dev-textures` writes it. Having a generator is a reason to
# keep one, not a reason to leave the output out of the repository: a clone
# has to work, and the generator being deterministic means a change to it
# shows up as a reviewable diff rather than as nothing at all.
*.kerotex
*.keromdl
*.keroaud
*.vault
*.keroprt
*.keroleak
*.kerowalk
content/maps/*.kerobsp


**/*.rs.bk
.DS_Store

# RustRover
/.idea
